# ============================================================================
# RECONSTRUCTED 2026-08-24 from observed live behaviour.
# THIS IS NOT THE ORIGINAL FILE. The original is not recoverable:
# Netlify never serves /_redirects, and its API returns only file metadata.
#
# Every line below was derived by fetching real URLs and recording what came
# back. The ROUTING is faithful. The exact original SYNTAX may have differed
# (Netlify accepts several equivalent forms), and any rule covering a path
# nobody thought to test is not here.
#
# Order matters: specific paths MUST stay above the /* wildcards.
# ============================================================================

# --- guest.plugservices.ca : forced catch-all -------------------------------
# Verified: /, /index.html, /events, /about, /login, /tickets, /anything-random
# and even /portal-organizer.html ALL return "My Tickets | PlugServices".
# The 200! is required - it overrides a real file of the same name.
https://guest.plugservices.ca/*        /portal-guest.html        200!
http://guest.plugservices.ca/*         /portal-guest.html        200!

# --- organizer.plugservices.ca : one specific path, then catch-all ----------
# Verified: /register returns "Register as an Organizer";
# /, /login, /events, /anything-random and /portal-guest.html all return
# "Organizer Portal". /register MUST precede the wildcard.
https://organizer.plugservices.ca/register   /organizer-register.html   200!
http://organizer.plugservices.ca/register    /organizer-register.html   200!
https://organizer.plugservices.ca/*          /portal-organizer.html     200!
http://organizer.plugservices.ca/*           /portal-organizer.html     200!

# --- apex / www friendly paths ---------------------------------------------
# Verified on plugservices.ca:
#   /guest-login      -> "My Tickets | PlugServices"
#   /organizer-login  -> "Organizer Portal | PlugServices"
/guest-login       /portal-guest.html        200
/organizer-login   /portal-organizer.html    200

# --- confirmed NOT routed (returned 404 on the apex) ------------------------
#   /register   /my-tickets   /checkin   /guest
# checkin.plugservices.ca has no DNS yet - see the project's open items.
#
# --- NOT a redirect rule ---------------------------------------------------
# Extensionless URLs (/events, /about, /city-calgary, /submit-event ...) work
# through Netlify's built-in Pretty URLs post-processing, not through this
# file. Both /events and /events.html return 200.
